lator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October is the driest pair at 6.50 inches of normal. In 2025 the middle of the grids came in at 54% in July to August and 46% in November to December. In 2026 so far it sat at 25% in January to February, then 176% in June to July. Grid 20568 had its driest year in 1963 at 54%.</p>"}
